WEBVTT

00:33.440 --> 00:35.050
<b>Where are you, Joker?!</b>

00:35.050 --> 00:38.800
<b>Show yourself, asshole!
We know you're here!</b>

00:38.800 --> 00:39.490
<b>Dammit.</b>

00:39.490 --> 00:40.410
<b>Be careful.</b>

00:40.410 --> 00:41.750
<b>Where did he go?</b>

00:41.750 --> 00:45.810
<b>Say, Harley, do you know
the trick to hunting rats?</b>

00:45.810 --> 00:48.630
<b>Huh? Oh, stop it, Puddin'.</b>

00:48.630 --> 00:51.730
<b>I don't wanna hear anything
about rats right now.</b>

00:51.730 --> 00:54.340
<b>Not when we could be talking about
something more erotic.</b>

00:54.340 --> 00:58.930
<b>I get it, Honey.
Nobody enjoys the sight of filth.</b>

00:59.800 --> 01:01.700
<b>-Hey! Get your ass out here!
-But there are just</b>

01:01.700 --> 01:02.580
<b>-too many dirty rats
-You see 'em?</b>

01:02.580 --> 01:04.600
<b>-infesting this city.
-Not here.</b>

01:04.600 --> 01:07.440
<b>Seriously, Joker? You hiding from us?</b>

01:07.440 --> 01:09.210
<b>Hey, come check this out.</b>

01:09.210 --> 01:11.150
<b>Like the gangs.</b>

01:11.150 --> 01:15.570
<b>They just shoot places up, steal money,
and kidnap people.</b>

01:15.570 --> 01:18.220
<b>They're the gutter trash of society.</b>

01:19.230 --> 01:20.490
<b>Found him?</b>

01:20.490 --> 01:23.450
<b>No, only some footprints. Two sets of 'em.</b>

01:23.450 --> 01:26.020
<b>Must belong to that jackass and Harley.</b>

01:26.020 --> 01:29.110
<b>The best way to hunt them down is...</b>

01:41.010 --> 01:44.040
<b>Mornin'! I slept like a baby!</b>

01:48.100 --> 01:49.730
<b>So I'm guessing nothing's changed?</b>

01:49.730 --> 01:50.540
<b>Yep.</b>

01:50.540 --> 01:53.070
<b>Did you guys really get the job done?</b>

01:53.070 --> 01:55.440
<b>Because the deal was they'd
give us freedom if you got results-</b>

01:55.440 --> 01:57.580
<b>Don't bitch at me about it!</b>

01:57.580 --> 02:00.990
<b>We might've went a little overboard,
but we got rid of them, okay?</b>

02:00.990 --> 02:01.930
<b>The job's done!</b>

02:02.610 --> 02:04.790
<b>I'm more worried about
our bombs right now.</b>

02:04.790 --> 02:05.750
<b>Time left?</b>

02:05.750 --> 02:07.620
<b>12 hours and 8 seconds.</b>

02:07.620 --> 02:08.790
<b>Shit.</b>

02:08.790 --> 02:11.460
<b>Behaving ourselves
and coming back here was a mistake.</b>

02:20.800 --> 02:21.840
<b>Um...</b>

02:21.840 --> 02:24.180
<b>I remember you sitting next to the Queen.</b>

02:24.180 --> 02:26.520
<b>Might you be the princess of this land?</b>

02:26.520 --> 02:29.210
<b>Yes, my name is Fione.</b>

02:29.540 --> 02:31.830
<b>Princess Fione!</b>

02:31.830 --> 02:33.650
<b>What a lovely name.</b>

02:33.650 --> 02:35.360
<b>Where does it come from?</b>

02:35.770 --> 02:39.150
<b>Some kind of flower?
Or perhaps from the local folklore-</b>

02:39.150 --> 02:40.470
<b>Screw that noise.</b>

02:40.470 --> 02:42.220
<b>Hey, girlie.</b>

02:42.570 --> 02:44.470
<b>When the hell are they letting us out?!</b>

02:45.320 --> 02:46.780
<b>Well...</b>

02:47.240 --> 02:50.620
<b>I'm sorry, but I have no idea.</b>

02:50.620 --> 02:54.090
<b>However, given the contributions
you made to retaking our fort,</b>

02:54.090 --> 02:55.730
<b>they should treat you well...</b>

02:56.410 --> 02:57.630
<b>My apologies.</b>

02:57.630 --> 02:59.970
<b>That doesn't sound
very convincing, does it?</b>

02:59.970 --> 03:01.630
<b>Not really.</b>

03:03.170 --> 03:03.990
<b>What?</b>

03:07.880 --> 03:10.140
<b>You've been checking
me out since yesterday.</b>

03:10.140 --> 03:11.500
<b>Don't think I haven't noticed.</b>

03:16.210 --> 03:18.920
<b>You got something to say to me?</b>

03:18.920 --> 03:20.320
<b>I...</b>

03:20.810 --> 03:22.840
<b>C'mon, get out with it!</b>

03:22.840 --> 03:25.160
<b>Relax. What's got you
so bent out of shape?</b>

03:25.160 --> 03:26.660
<b>Nothing!</b>

03:26.660 --> 03:30.000
<b>The look of this little princess
just rubs me the wrong way.</b>

03:30.000 --> 03:31.600
<b>Okay, so you are bent out of shape.</b>

03:31.600 --> 03:32.920
<b>I can't help it!</b>

03:32.920 --> 03:37.710
<b>She's too damn timid to speak her mind and
freaked out about what other people think.</b>

03:39.920 --> 03:41.920
<b>Just like a little wimp I used to know.</b>

03:44.170 --> 03:45.070
<b>Princess!</b>

03:45.760 --> 03:49.290
<b>You mustn't come here,
especially without an escort!</b>

03:49.290 --> 03:51.020
<b>It's about damn time.</b>

03:51.020 --> 03:53.220
<b>Get out. The queen has summoned you.</b>

03:54.060 --> 03:55.360
<b>-Nana!
-Typically, guys like him</b>

03:55.360 --> 03:57.560
<b>-get killed off at the start.
-C'mon, wakey-wakey!</b>

05:32.430 --> 05:33.580
<b>Fio!</b>

05:47.860 --> 05:49.720
<b>Wow!</b>

05:50.460 --> 05:52.640
<b>So high up! This is amazing!</b>

05:52.640 --> 05:55.620
<b>Yeah, it's not my
favorite spot for nothing.</b>

05:55.620 --> 05:57.890
<b>But isn't your place even taller, Fio?</b>

05:57.890 --> 06:01.050
<b>Quite, but I have never climbed it
by my lonesome.</b>

06:01.050 --> 06:04.440
<b>Hey, cut the fancy talk.
You're disguised as a commoner, right?</b>

06:04.440 --> 06:07.350
<b>Oh, forgive... I mean, my bad.</b>

06:07.350 --> 06:11.470
<b>How's your little brother, Knoll, doing?
Is he feeling all right now?</b>

06:11.470 --> 06:13.030
<b>More or less.</b>

06:13.030 --> 06:16.040
<b>But they hiked the prices up
on bread again.</b>

06:16.040 --> 06:18.670
<b>And there ain't no more chimneys to sweep.</b>

06:18.670 --> 06:20.610
<b>Maybe I'll get 'em dirty myself.</b>

06:20.610 --> 06:22.170
<b>Don't be silly.</b>

06:22.170 --> 06:24.850
<b>Milady, where are you?</b>

06:24.850 --> 06:26.010
<b>You need to go home soon or,</b>

06:26.010 --> 06:28.990
<b>-Aw, time's up already.
-um, you'll be scolded!</b>

06:28.990 --> 06:30.420
<b>-Milady!
-Hey, Fio.</b>

06:30.420 --> 06:32.100
<b>When's the war going to end?</b>

06:32.100 --> 06:33.300
<b>I don't know.</b>

06:33.300 --> 06:35.910
<b>They're still clashing
with each other, huh?</b>

06:36.180 --> 06:37.890
<b>Where is it this time?</b>

06:37.890 --> 06:40.600
<b>Over there. Near the mountains.</b>

06:41.260 --> 06:42.750
<b>To hell with 'em!</b>

06:47.400 --> 06:51.030
<b>I hear that you've been taking trips
into the city to play around.</b>

06:52.980 --> 06:56.920
<b>It was the city guards who informed me.
Not Cecil.</b>

06:56.920 --> 06:59.540
<b>In fact, he tried to cover for you
the whole time.</b>

06:59.540 --> 07:01.520
<b>Shame on you.</b>

07:01.520 --> 07:05.130
<b>You forced the future commander
of the Royal Knights to lie.</b>

07:06.540 --> 07:09.260
<b>Remember that we are members of royalty
who have a higher status</b>

07:09.260 --> 07:11.590
<b>and different duty from the peasants.</b>

07:11.590 --> 07:13.170
<b>Go and clean yourself up.</b>

07:13.170 --> 07:14.300
<b>Mother!</b>

07:14.300 --> 07:17.290
<b>What is our duty? Can you tell me?</b>

07:18.180 --> 07:20.560
<b>To bring an end to the war.</b>

07:42.080 --> 07:43.400
<b>Princess.</b>

07:43.400 --> 07:44.790
<b>Princess.</b>

07:44.790 --> 07:46.040
<b>Princess!</b>

07:48.710 --> 07:49.710
<b>Yes?</b>

07:49.710 --> 07:51.400
<b>It's almost time to begin.</b>

07:51.400 --> 07:53.840
<b>My apologies. The war council, right?</b>

07:53.840 --> 07:56.970
<b>Yes. But there is no need
for you to attend...</b>

07:56.970 --> 07:59.280
<b>No, I'm going.</b>

07:59.280 --> 08:00.890
<b>I would like to be there.</b>

08:14.140 --> 08:15.240
<b>So many of them!</b>

08:15.240 --> 08:17.030
<b>I've never seen anything like it!</b>

08:18.860 --> 08:20.100
<b>Report the situation.</b>

08:20.100 --> 08:21.330
<b>Yes.</b>

08:22.410 --> 08:23.580
<b>Currently,</b>

08:23.580 --> 08:27.790
<b>the Imperial Army is marching towards
the plains through this forest here.</b>

08:27.790 --> 08:30.590
<b>Fortunately, they are moving
at a slow pace.</b>

08:30.590 --> 08:33.090
<b>However, the guards that we left posted
at the reclaimed fortress</b>

08:33.090 --> 08:35.170
<b>will not be enough
to handle their numbers.</b>

08:35.630 --> 08:36.680
<b>Unless we do something,</b>

08:36.680 --> 08:39.220
<b>they will force their way
across the bridge within a day or two.</b>

08:41.970 --> 08:45.500
<b>Um, hello? Hey, folks!</b>

08:45.720 --> 08:48.810
<b>Care to explain why
we're still in shackles?</b>

08:48.810 --> 08:52.010
<b>I thought we had a deal
about being set free.</b>

08:52.010 --> 08:53.110
<b>How dare you!</b>

08:53.110 --> 08:54.860
<b>Know your place when you speak!</b>

08:54.860 --> 08:56.400
<b>This is a war council!</b>

08:58.760 --> 09:00.330
<b>You have some nerve to say that</b>

09:00.330 --> 09:02.870
<b>after destroying the very fort
I sent you to reclaim.</b>

09:02.870 --> 09:05.290
<b>Uh-oh, are we gonna
get executed or somethin'?</b>

09:05.870 --> 09:07.520
<b>You there, near the aisle.</b>

09:07.520 --> 09:08.890
<b>Yes?</b>

09:08.890 --> 09:11.880
<b>You said you had intelligence
about the Empire's senior officers.</b>

09:11.880 --> 09:14.630
<b>Who is the one leading this army?</b>

09:14.630 --> 09:17.880
<b>And how do they keep such
strict command of their troops?</b>

09:20.540 --> 09:21.930
<b>Before we get to that,</b>

09:21.930 --> 09:24.890
<b>could you please tell me the
sequence of events leading up to this war?</b>

09:24.890 --> 09:27.730
<b>I'd like to have a better understanding
of the enemy's situation.</b>

09:28.140 --> 09:29.110
<b>Cecil.</b>

09:29.110 --> 09:29.790
<b>Yes.</b>

09:30.480 --> 09:32.940
<b>Our Kingdom has been waging war
against the Imperial forces</b>

09:32.940 --> 09:35.020
<b>for multiple decades now.</b>

09:35.360 --> 09:37.660
<b>For a long time,
they were mere skirmishes,</b>

09:37.660 --> 09:40.740
<b>but it has intensified drastically
in these last six months.</b>

09:40.740 --> 09:42.870
<b>Mostly due to the fact that the
Elves and Beastmen</b>

09:42.870 --> 09:44.950
<b>betrayed us to side with the Empire.</b>

09:44.950 --> 09:46.370
<b>They betrayed you?</b>

09:46.370 --> 09:47.370
<b>That's right.</b>

09:47.370 --> 09:49.810
<b>The Beastmen who we fought
at the fort the other day</b>

09:49.810 --> 09:52.040
<b>were originally subjects of our kingdom.</b>

09:55.920 --> 09:58.820
<b>Goddamn traitors, threatening the peace.</b>

09:58.820 --> 09:59.960
<b>Oh yeah?</b>

09:59.960 --> 10:02.080
<b>Perhaps they simply didn't care
for your kingdom.</b>

10:02.080 --> 10:03.850
<b>Guy's got a point.</b>

10:03.850 --> 10:06.330
<b>I mean, just look at how
you treat your war heroes.</b>

10:10.310 --> 10:14.410
<b>I'm betting that it was Ratcatcher who
caused the Beastmen to betray you.</b>

10:14.410 --> 10:16.020
<b>Ratcatcher?</b>

10:16.770 --> 10:19.320
<b>The man who's leading this army.</b>

10:19.320 --> 10:22.910
<b>He had the power to communicate
with rats in our world.</b>

10:22.910 --> 10:25.850
<b>So it's very likely he used his power to
communicate with the Beastmen here, too.</b>

10:25.850 --> 10:29.140
<b>You sound pretty damn confident.</b>

10:29.140 --> 10:32.290
<b>He never had that much power
when I was with him in the joint.</b>

10:32.290 --> 10:33.340
<b>Shut up!</b>

10:33.340 --> 10:35.850
<b>We need to bluff our way
out of this right now!</b>

10:35.850 --> 10:38.700
<b>Then how do you suggest
we stop their army?</b>

10:38.700 --> 10:40.200
<b>Well...</b>

10:40.200 --> 10:42.640
<b>A way to stop the rat bastard, huh?</b>

10:42.640 --> 10:44.320
<b>More like how to hunt him.</b>

10:44.320 --> 10:46.350
<b>-Because I'm gonna kill that slimeball
-Rats...</b>

10:46.350 --> 10:48.180
<b>a million times over
for disturbing the peace.</b>

10:48.180 --> 10:49.640
<b>Here's a better question.</b>

10:49.640 --> 10:53.690
<b>Why didn't you and your advance party just
blow his head off after he went rouge?</b>

10:53.690 --> 10:57.070
<b>You planted a bomb in that
rat bastard's neck, too, right?</b>

10:57.070 --> 11:01.240
<b>I have no idea how, but the bombs
got defused without me noticing.</b>

11:01.240 --> 11:05.530
<b>Which is probably why Director Waller
made sure that yours included a countdown.</b>

11:06.030 --> 11:07.480
<b>Well, shit.</b>

11:11.330 --> 11:13.000
<b>Is that all you can offer?</b>

11:13.000 --> 11:14.210
<b>Then back to the prison with yo-</b>

11:14.210 --> 11:14.980
<b>Hunting rats.</b>

11:14.980 --> 11:16.090
<b>Huh?</b>

11:16.090 --> 11:18.110
<b>The trick to hunting rats!
How'd I forget!</b>

11:18.110 --> 11:22.560
<b>You're a genius, Puddin'!
Seriously, the best man alive!</b>

11:22.560 --> 11:25.080
<b>Jeez, did you smuggle in
some booze or what?</b>

11:25.080 --> 11:26.770
<b>Mind letting me take a swig of it, too?</b>

11:26.770 --> 11:28.020
<b>Excuse you!</b>

11:28.020 --> 11:30.100
<b>I was just remembering something
Puddin' told me once!</b>

11:30.100 --> 11:31.370
<b>A good way to get rid of rats!</b>

11:33.520 --> 11:35.380
<b>I see.</b>

11:35.380 --> 11:37.690
<b>D-do you have a good idea?</b>

11:37.690 --> 11:38.860
<b>Sort of.</b>

11:38.860 --> 11:41.380
<b>Anybody that's fought him before
would come to the same conclusion.</b>

11:41.380 --> 11:42.740
<b>Right?</b>

11:43.230 --> 11:46.030
<b>Except that's gonna require us
to not only stop his army,</b>

11:46.030 --> 11:47.660
<b>but force him to the frontlines.</b>

11:47.660 --> 11:49.330
<b>We don't have enough people.</b>

11:50.450 --> 11:53.380
<b>Your Majesty, may we please
borrow part of your army?</b>

11:53.380 --> 11:55.500
<b>And when we successfully
stop their forces this time,</b>

11:55.500 --> 11:57.590
<b>will you grant us
the freedom you promised?</b>

11:57.590 --> 11:58.880
<b>That's absurd!</b>

11:58.880 --> 12:00.550
<b>How dare you even suggest that!</b>

12:00.550 --> 12:02.180
<b>You people need to understand that-</b>

12:02.180 --> 12:03.130
<b>Um...</b>

12:03.130 --> 12:06.370
<b>I think it would be beneficial
to show these people some trust.</b>

12:06.370 --> 12:09.430
<b>Please stay out of this, Princess.</b>

12:09.430 --> 12:11.810
<b>Are you willing to bear the responsibility</b>

12:11.810 --> 12:14.560
<b>if they end up letting
our troops die for nothing?</b>

12:14.560 --> 12:15.690
<b>Well...</b>

12:19.230 --> 12:21.740
<b>Princess, that would be far too reckless.</b>

12:21.740 --> 12:24.070
<b>The only knights who are
still fit for battle right now</b>

12:24.070 --> 12:25.450
<b>are the ones directly under me.</b>

12:25.450 --> 12:26.780
<b>They won't be enough to-</b>

12:26.780 --> 12:28.600
<b>What are you talking about?</b>

12:28.900 --> 12:31.310
<b>You've got a whole bunch of guys
raring to go, don'tcha?</b>

12:43.240 --> 12:44.720
<b>-That's what I heard.
-Really?</b>

12:44.720 --> 12:45.950
<b>Well...</b>

12:53.260 --> 12:55.540
<b>What took you so long, Beanstalk?</b>

12:55.540 --> 12:57.270
<b>Wait, let me guess.</b>

12:57.270 --> 12:58.570
<b>You haven't been outside in forever,</b>

12:58.570 --> 13:00.170
<b>so you took a little detour
to enjoy the fresh air?</b>

13:01.810 --> 13:02.900
<b>That's exactly the kind of stupid shit</b>

13:02.900 --> 13:05.070
<b>-Jeez, this stuff is chewy.
-I figured was coming out of your mouth.</b>

13:05.980 --> 13:09.700
<b>But I never thought a lowly human
would be ordering me around.</b>

13:11.200 --> 13:13.050
<b>So, where's the action?</b>

13:13.050 --> 13:14.330
<b>Over there.</b>

13:14.330 --> 13:17.510
<b>Our side is still getting stuff ready,
so give them a hand later.</b>

13:17.510 --> 13:18.790
<b>All righty.</b>

13:20.250 --> 13:21.780
<b>Hi, everybody!</b>

13:21.780 --> 13:22.920
<b>Bossbabe!</b>

13:22.920 --> 13:24.840
<b>You can speak our language now?</b>

13:24.840 --> 13:26.680
<b>Okay, quiet down, boys.</b>

13:26.680 --> 13:31.000
<b>Work hard today and you can finally
kiss that shitty prison goodbye!</b>

13:31.000 --> 13:33.790
<b>Otherwise, you're going straight back.</b>

13:33.790 --> 13:35.790
<b>Are you ready to kick ass?!</b>

13:35.790 --> 13:39.190
<b>Yeah!</b>

13:43.300 --> 13:44.860
<b>Eh?</b>

13:45.800 --> 13:47.780
<b>Just hurry and get it done.</b>

13:49.100 --> 13:50.240
<b>Christ.</b>

13:50.240 --> 13:53.580
<b>N-Nanaue! That food is for the knights!</b>

13:53.580 --> 13:55.210
<b>You've already had enough today!</b>

13:55.210 --> 13:57.730
<b>Peacemaker! At least try to stop him!</b>

13:57.730 --> 13:59.500
<b>These friggin' shitheads...</b>

13:59.500 --> 14:00.630
<b>Huh?</b>

14:00.630 --> 14:02.790
<b>Where did Deadshot go?</b>

14:10.090 --> 14:11.930
<b>You're a soldier, right?</b>

14:11.930 --> 14:12.920
<b>Sure am.</b>

14:12.920 --> 14:14.770
<b>I don't know much about your situation,</b>

14:14.770 --> 14:17.150
<b>but these people are criminals,
aren't they?</b>

14:17.150 --> 14:19.830
<b>Doesn't it bother you
to fight alongside them?</b>

14:19.830 --> 14:21.940
<b>Do I look happy about it?!</b>

14:28.190 --> 14:29.240
<b>Sorry.</b>

14:29.240 --> 14:32.870
<b>Soldiers have to follow the orders
they're given from the top.</b>

14:32.870 --> 14:34.160
<b>Right?!</b>

14:39.120 --> 14:40.210
<b>Nice work.</b>

14:40.210 --> 14:43.430
<b>They're not pretty to look at,
but they'll have to do.</b>

14:43.430 --> 14:44.460
<b>Good grief.</b>

14:44.460 --> 14:47.070
<b>Being a stagehand isn't my thing,
you know!</b>

14:47.070 --> 14:49.730
<b>All right. This is where we are.</b>

14:49.730 --> 14:51.720
<b>And the barriers that
Clayface set up are here,</b>

14:51.720 --> 14:54.860
<b>along with the defense line
of knights and ogres.</b>

14:54.860 --> 14:56.620
<b>It was a rush job, so it's not the best.</b>

14:56.620 --> 14:58.310
<b>Eh, it'll be fine.</b>

14:58.310 --> 14:59.770
<b>Take this more seriously!</b>

14:59.770 --> 15:02.340
<b>The very fate of the Kingdom
depends on it!</b>

15:02.720 --> 15:03.590
<b>Bleh.</b>

15:04.310 --> 15:07.360
<b>Where's your other friend?
I don't see him around.</b>

15:07.360 --> 15:09.440
<b>Deadshot, was it?</b>

15:09.440 --> 15:10.610
<b>He's up on the roof.</b>

15:10.610 --> 15:13.370
<b>To keep watch?
Let my men handle that instead.</b>

15:13.370 --> 15:15.620
<b>Nah, just leave him be.</b>

15:15.620 --> 15:18.410
<b>Nobody makes a sandwich
without melting the butter</b>

15:18.410 --> 15:20.540
<b>and frying the bacon
to a crisp first, right?</b>

15:20.540 --> 15:23.160
<b>Preparation is everything.</b>

15:24.370 --> 15:27.840
<b>I'll take over if he screws the pooch.
Don't worry.</b>

15:27.840 --> 15:29.660
<b>Pardon me, Mr. Commander.</b>

15:29.660 --> 15:31.970
<b>Could you tell us what
Princess Fione is like?</b>

15:31.970 --> 15:33.180
<b>Why do you ask?</b>

15:33.180 --> 15:34.260
<b>Just curious.</b>

15:34.260 --> 15:37.180
<b>I got the impression
that she wanted to ask us something.</b>

15:37.180 --> 15:38.790
<b>You're close to her, right?</b>

15:39.840 --> 15:41.480
<b>She is very kind-hearted.</b>

15:41.480 --> 15:45.020
<b>No one in the castle cares for
our subjects as much as she does.</b>

15:45.600 --> 15:47.860
<b>She doesn't actually care about
anybody else,</b>

15:47.860 --> 15:49.900
<b>she's just a whiny, self-loathing loser.</b>

15:49.900 --> 15:51.320
<b>Too busy hating herself.</b>

15:51.320 --> 15:52.300
<b>How dare you!</b>

15:52.300 --> 15:54.320
<b>It's called being introspective!</b>

15:54.320 --> 15:55.870
<b>-Are they here, Nanaue?
-I'll have you know, the princess</b>

15:55.870 --> 15:56.560
<b>used to be very active-</b>

16:12.420 --> 16:13.420
<b>Okay.</b>

16:13.840 --> 16:16.300
<b>I'll go take command
of the knights on the frontlines.</b>

16:16.300 --> 16:18.260
<b>And you guys will lead the ogres.</b>

16:18.260 --> 16:19.810
<b>What? We don't gotta do squat.</b>

16:19.810 --> 16:21.890
<b>Beanstalk and his friends
are totally ready for action.</b>

16:22.720 --> 16:24.100
<b>Don't be ridiculous!</b>

16:24.100 --> 16:26.220
<b>You're the only ones here
that have experience</b>

16:26.220 --> 16:27.840
<b>fighting against the enemy commander!</b>

16:27.840 --> 16:31.570
<b>It's no big diff whether a few of us
join you out there or not.</b>

16:31.570 --> 16:33.740
<b>I mean, think about it.</b>

16:35.070 --> 16:37.160
<b>Yes, far too uncivilized for me.</b>

16:37.160 --> 16:39.270
<b>And I would hate to get covered in dust.</b>

16:39.270 --> 16:41.080
<b>My job is to be backup.</b>

16:41.080 --> 16:43.080
<b>I can't go anywhere.</b>

16:47.910 --> 16:49.130
<b>Damn outsiders!</b>

16:49.130 --> 16:50.740
<b>Hey, wait!</b>

16:52.460 --> 16:53.620
<b>Welp.</b>

16:53.620 --> 16:55.990
<b>Time to hit 'em with your best shot.</b>

16:55.990 --> 16:58.240
<b>All troops, halt.</b>

16:58.720 --> 17:01.520
<b>Huh? What the hell?</b>

17:01.520 --> 17:05.280
<b>Barriers? Where'd those come from?</b>

17:05.280 --> 17:07.000
<b>And those shadows nearby...</b>

17:07.000 --> 17:09.350
<b>are those prisoners?</b>

17:21.320 --> 17:24.160
<b>So they think they've amassed
enough soldiers now?</b>

17:24.160 --> 17:25.870
<b>Not by a long shot!</b>

17:35.000 --> 17:36.780
<b>-We're way outnumbered!
-How can we compete with that?</b>

17:37.000 --> 17:38.340
<b>There's no end to them.</b>

17:39.670 --> 17:41.050
<b>Stay focused!</b>

17:42.090 --> 17:45.030
<b>Fear not the numbers of our foe!</b>

17:45.030 --> 17:49.020
<b>Fear for the lives of the citizens who
rely on us for protection!</b>

17:49.470 --> 17:51.020
<b>Make it painfully clear,</b>

17:51.020 --> 17:55.610
<b>and teach these bastards that marching
over our dead bodies is no easy task!</b>

17:55.980 --> 17:58.240
<b>Show them our pride as knights!</b>

18:05.370 --> 18:08.830
<b>I know you're out there, Deadshot!</b>

18:08.830 --> 18:10.880
<b>I'm gonna tear you limb from limb!</b>

18:10.880 --> 18:13.490
<b>Now charge, my beasts!</b>

18:13.490 --> 18:15.570
<b>Huh? What the...</b>

18:29.640 --> 18:33.020
<b>You just missed a golden opportunity,
you self-centered son of a bitch!</b>

18:33.020 --> 18:35.820
<b>Go! Our target is atop the fort!</b>

18:36.810 --> 18:40.120
<b>What's the problem?
Get moving, you mutts!</b>

18:40.120 --> 18:42.950
<b>C'mon! Up there! Go!</b>

18:42.950 --> 18:45.830
<b>Hurry up, worthless fleabags!
Or no more food!</b>

18:45.830 --> 18:47.870
<b>You smelly ************s!</b>

18:47.870 --> 18:50.130
<b>I'm gonna shove firecrackers
up your *******s!</b>

18:50.130 --> 18:53.250
<b>Stupid horny *******s that go around
****ing each other all the time!</b>

18:53.250 --> 18:57.150
<b>What's the matter... with you...?</b>

18:59.500 --> 19:01.590
<b>So, somebody wanna explain the real plan?</b>

19:01.590 --> 19:04.110
<b>Seriously? This was your idea.</b>

19:04.110 --> 19:05.810
<b>Whatever.</b>

19:05.810 --> 19:09.000
<b>Remember what happened
the last time we fought here?</b>

19:09.000 --> 19:12.310
<b>Ratcatcher himself doesn't have
the ability to control the Beastmen.</b>

19:12.310 --> 19:13.210
<b>Which means...</b>

19:16.380 --> 19:19.840
<b>it's gotta be that shiny magical staff.</b>

19:19.840 --> 19:22.800
<b>So we just find a way
to lure him into the open.</b>

19:22.800 --> 19:25.520
<b>Then I target his staff and... blamo.</b>

19:26.320 --> 19:28.860
<b>No way. It was all for this?</b>

19:28.860 --> 19:31.250
<b>They built those barriers
and gathered up those troops</b>

19:31.250 --> 19:35.580
<b>just to goad me into powering up
my beasts out on the frontlines?</b>

19:38.990 --> 19:40.340
<b>Wait, wait!</b>

19:40.340 --> 19:41.460
<b>(TREMBLE, TREMBLE)</b>

19:45.760 --> 19:47.370
<b>W-wait!</b>

19:49.180 --> 19:51.230
<b>Wait, wait, wait! Just hold on!</b>

19:51.230 --> 19:54.430
<b>We built a connection
even without this stupid thing!</b>

19:54.430 --> 19:57.420
<b>We're buddies! Best buddies! Right?!</b>

19:57.420 --> 19:59.820
<b>I've never had any human friends!</b>

19:59.820 --> 20:02.490
<b>Rats are the only company
I've had since I was little!</b>

20:02.490 --> 20:04.530
<b>I've always been shunned and made fun of
by other people!</b>

20:04.530 --> 20:05.660
<b>Honest!</b>

20:08.240 --> 20:11.160
<b>The best way to hunt them down is...</b>

20:17.580 --> 20:20.010
<b>Shit! The place just blew up on us!</b>

20:20.010 --> 20:21.590
<b>Huh? Who are you mofos?!</b>

20:21.590 --> 20:23.160
<b>What are you doing in here?!</b>

20:23.160 --> 20:24.550
<b>Nah, you tell us first!</b>

20:24.550 --> 20:26.140
<b>This is our turf!</b>

20:26.140 --> 20:28.040
<b>Look, we're just here for the Joker!</b>

20:28.300 --> 20:31.680
<b>There he is! Fire! Fire! Fire!</b>

20:52.730 --> 20:56.210
<b>...by making them feed on each other.</b>

20:58.040 --> 21:00.230
<b>My Puddin' is such a genius.</b>

21:00.830 --> 21:03.590
<b>Hey, nice work. You pulled it off!</b>

21:04.250 --> 21:07.260
<b>He was only like 700 meters away from us.
It was a cinch.</b>

21:07.260 --> 21:10.010
<b>Anyway, you guys better learn from this.</b>

21:10.330 --> 21:13.180
<b>I did that guy so many damn favors.</b>

21:13.180 --> 21:16.480
<b>But put kindness out in the world
and all you get is a knife in the back!</b>

21:17.220 --> 21:18.130
<b>Ya dig?!</b>

21:21.940 --> 21:24.050
<b>Where are we?</b>

21:24.050 --> 21:25.700
<b>Huh?</b>

21:25.700 --> 21:28.640
<b>Hey, aren't those
the knights of the kingdom?</b>

21:30.780 --> 21:32.450
<b>What's going on?</b>

21:32.990 --> 21:35.390
<b>We're gonna go ahead and leave now.</b>

21:35.830 --> 21:37.790
<b>Wait. What did you do?!</b>

21:37.790 --> 21:41.840
<b>We ain't got time to explain.
We beat 'em, just like we promised.</b>

21:41.840 --> 21:44.340
<b>So we're free to do what we want, right?</b>

21:44.340 --> 21:45.550
<b>Well...</b>

21:45.550 --> 21:46.910
<b>Commander!</b>

21:48.170 --> 21:49.100
<b>I have a message!</b>

21:49.100 --> 21:51.910
<b>The enemy army is willing to surrender!
What shall we do?</b>

21:52.800 --> 21:54.560
<b>I suppose we accept.</b>

21:54.560 --> 21:56.270
<b>Okay, show's over, folks!</b>

21:56.270 --> 21:57.850
<b>Hurry and take us to the Gate.</b>

21:57.850 --> 21:58.810
<b>All right.</b>

21:58.810 --> 22:01.150
<b>Man, I need a shower like yesterday.</b>

22:01.150 --> 22:02.690
<b>Hmm. A shower, huh?</b>

22:02.690 --> 22:04.990
<b>I'd be very curious to see
how far the sanitary facilities</b>

22:04.990 --> 22:06.360
<b>have developed in this world.</b>

22:06.360 --> 22:08.160
<b>Their water seems clean enough.</b>

22:08.160 --> 22:09.370
<b>You're washing up no matter what.</b>

22:09.370 --> 22:10.350
<b>Of course.</b>

22:10.350 --> 22:11.570
<b>-What's going on?
-It doesn't seem</b>

22:11.570 --> 22:12.620
<b>like they're going to fight.</b>

22:12.620 --> 22:14.350
<b>Someone just came to fill us in.</b>

22:16.280 --> 22:18.080
<b>I have a report from Commander Cecil!</b>

22:18.080 --> 22:21.210
<b>He says the battle at the plains
has been won!</b>

22:22.120 --> 22:23.500
<b>Wonderful news!</b>

22:23.960 --> 22:25.860
<b>They've done it, Mothe-</b>

22:31.840 --> 22:33.760
<b>Mother...?</b>
